WEBVTT

01:55.360 --> 01:59.120
SPIRIT OF MEI LIN
MOON KUNLUN, AND THE PRINCESS HEIR

02:13.360 --> 02:15.040
Moon Kunlun

02:15.120 --> 02:17.120
Collect the clear light

02:18.360 --> 02:21.760
Fall to the west with the moon
And never return

02:24.560 --> 02:26.200
Moon Kunlun

02:26.840 --> 02:28.080
Collect the clear light

02:29.640 --> 02:33.040
Fall to the west with the moon
And never return

02:34.840 --> 02:35.920
Moon Kunlun

02:36.960 --> 02:38.800
Collect the clear light

02:39.600 --> 02:40.440
Fall to the west with the moon

02:40.520 --> 02:42.120
- And never return
- My Lord, what's wrong?

02:42.200 --> 02:43.200
What are you singing?

02:44.880 --> 02:48.760
Moon Kunlun has fallen with the moon

02:50.840 --> 02:53.240
My Lord, they must be mistaken.

02:53.320 --> 02:54.440
It must be a mistake.

03:01.080 --> 03:04.040
Mei Lin, you're not allowed to die.

03:35.480 --> 03:41.240
SPIRIT OF MEI LIN
MOON KUNLUN, AND THE PRINCESS HEIR

03:41.320 --> 03:42.560
Let's bury her here.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.920
The Princess Heir loved spring flowers.

04:00.040 --> 04:05.240
A fortune-teller once told me
I could live to 100 years,

04:07.160 --> 04:13.680
carrying the hopes
of my father and mother.

04:19.399 --> 04:22.200
Weren't you fighting to live?

04:23.280 --> 04:24.240
Why?

04:25.480 --> 04:27.560
You shouldn't be lying here.

04:33.160 --> 04:35.440
You want to be buried in spring flowers.

04:36.240 --> 04:37.640
I won't allow it.

04:38.480 --> 04:42.640
You want to rest in peace,
but I won't allow it!

05:46.920 --> 05:47.760
Mei,

05:50.280 --> 05:51.880
I'll take you home.

07:08.360 --> 07:10.200
Why is the governor carrying a dead woman?

07:10.840 --> 07:11.800
She's not moving.

07:11.880 --> 07:13.240
She must be dead.

07:14.120 --> 07:16.400
The rumor that the governor
dug up a grave is true.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.800
Has the governor gone mad?

07:18.880 --> 07:19.720
Keep your voice down.

07:20.320 --> 07:21.360
Check out my stone hairpins.

07:21.440 --> 07:22.480
- Keep your voice down.
- Let's go.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.680
Check out my stone hairpins.

07:24.680 --> 07:25.720
Come and take a look.

07:26.400 --> 07:27.920
Check out my stone hairpins.

07:30.080 --> 07:32.320
You returned your old hairpin
to your mother.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.960
I'll get you a new one.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.440
It's a lovely stone hairpin.

07:44.520 --> 07:45.680
I'll put it on for you.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.720
General Qingyan, I beg you.

08:34.799 --> 08:37.360
Please let me take Mei away
to rest in peace.

08:37.440 --> 08:38.760
Get up. Get up, Misses.

08:38.840 --> 08:39.880
Get up now, Misses.

08:42.400 --> 08:44.280
Give His Excellency more time.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.640
I'll find a way.

08:51.000 --> 08:52.360
It's been three days.

08:52.440 --> 08:54.400
Prince Jing still won't let go.
What should we do?

10:10.360 --> 10:13.800
FENGCAO PAVILION

10:13.880 --> 10:15.840
Qingyan, His Excellency…

10:17.440 --> 10:19.800
Officer Li, His Excellency is sick.

10:20.440 --> 10:23.200
I can pass on the paperwork
for restoring the old streets.

10:23.280 --> 10:24.320
Alright.

10:25.120 --> 10:25.960
Is His Excellency all right?

10:26.880 --> 10:28.680
He hasn't been out for a few days.

10:29.240 --> 10:31.760
His Excellency is just suffering
from a cold. He'll be fine.

10:32.640 --> 10:33.480
I'm glad to hear that.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.520
I'll take my leave now.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.960
Look, I've beaten you.

10:41.800 --> 10:43.960
Concubine Yan, you're skilled
at shooting Go chess pieces.

10:44.040 --> 10:44.880
I admit defeat.

10:45.840 --> 10:49.480
Tomorrow, I'll send another hu of pearls
from the South Sea.

10:49.560 --> 10:53.520
Your Majesty,
I have three rooms full of your gifts.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.600
I have yet to check them.

10:54.680 --> 10:57.120
What do you want? Just tell me.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.640
I want to go for a walk.

11:02.640 --> 11:04.840
I promise I won't go far.

11:05.480 --> 11:08.160
I'll just admire the flowers
in the Imperial Garden.

11:08.240 --> 11:10.800
You haven't been well
since you were conceived.

11:10.880 --> 11:12.440
The imperial physicians
told you to rest in bed.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.240
It's unfair to you.

11:16.800 --> 11:19.800
Your Majesty, I shouldn't be so wild.

11:20.960 --> 11:24.240
When I was young,
my brother tried to teach me Weiqi,

11:24.840 --> 11:26.520
but I couldn't sit still to learn.

11:27.600 --> 11:30.000
Otherwise, I'd be playing Weiqi
with Your Majesty

11:30.080 --> 11:31.600
instead of shooting pieces.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.480
You hurt yourself saving me.

11:35.040 --> 11:36.960
I didn't want you to have this baby.

11:38.360 --> 11:40.160
But I am much older than you.

11:40.880 --> 11:43.080
If I can leave you an heir,

11:43.600 --> 11:46.080
it will be a reliance for you
in the future.

11:46.680 --> 11:49.000
No, no. Your Majesty, you'll live…

11:52.880 --> 11:54.520
You'll live…

11:56.000 --> 11:58.600
Your Majesty, you're in good health
and can stay with me for a long time.

11:59.920 --> 12:03.760
At worst,
your hair is a little grayer than mine.

12:05.000 --> 12:07.560
The imperial physicians said
you can't go out now.

12:08.280 --> 12:10.640
In a few months, when the fetus is stable,

12:10.720 --> 12:12.400
I'll accompany you for a walk.

12:13.000 --> 12:14.680
What else do you want?

12:14.760 --> 12:16.680
Name one more request.
I'll make it happen.

12:19.840 --> 12:21.600
I miss my brother.

12:24.160 --> 12:25.920
I wonder if there's any news
of my brother.

12:26.680 --> 12:29.200
I also wonder how my brother
and Mei Lin are doing.

12:29.280 --> 12:32.200
I don't know if Mei Lin
will let my brother in.

12:34.720 --> 12:37.640
The marriage of the Prince Heir
and Princess Heir was sanctioned by me.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.000
There will be no problem.

12:40.680 --> 12:43.440
I promise I'll tell you right away

12:44.160 --> 12:45.720
if there's any news.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.760
I knew you'd dote on me the most,
Your Majesty.

12:49.560 --> 12:50.400
Let's proceed.

12:57.640 --> 13:03.800
FANGHUA PALACE

13:06.720 --> 13:12.240
Wang Bao, don't tell Concubine Yan
about the princess's death yet.

13:12.320 --> 13:13.200
Yes, Your Majesty.

13:41.080 --> 13:43.640
His Majesty ordered that as long as
Your Highness obeys His Majesty…

13:43.720 --> 13:47.400
PRINCE HEIR'S MANSION

14:14.400 --> 14:15.680
Without eating or drinking,

14:16.920 --> 14:18.320
you'll fall ill.

14:41.920 --> 14:43.320
You're so stubborn.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.080
Fine.

14:48.520 --> 14:51.040
You don't have to drink it
if you don't want to.

14:52.160 --> 14:53.440
I won't drink it either.

15:03.280 --> 15:04.640
Do you remember

15:05.560 --> 15:06.880
when we left the hunting grounds,

15:07.840 --> 15:09.480
you slept for three days?

15:12.280 --> 15:15.720
You survived that kind of danger.

15:16.760 --> 15:20.440
This time, you will be safe and sound too.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.720
I know

15:23.640 --> 15:25.080
you're still angry at me.

15:34.760 --> 15:37.880
You're scaring me, right?

16:10.200 --> 16:12.080
Physician! Physician!

16:13.800 --> 16:15.280
My Lord. My Lord.

16:15.360 --> 16:16.280
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

16:16.880 --> 16:17.760
My Lord.

16:17.840 --> 16:18.680
Cure her.

16:18.760 --> 16:20.280
I know you can cure her.

16:20.360 --> 16:21.200
Cure her!

16:21.800 --> 16:24.000
I'm incompetent.
Please punish me, my Lord.

16:24.840 --> 16:27.320
If you don't cure her, I will kill you!

16:27.400 --> 16:31.920
My Lord, even if you kill me,
Miss Mei Lin won't come back to life.

16:32.000 --> 16:35.160
My Lord, Miss Mei Lin is dead.

17:16.040 --> 17:17.520
It's because of me.

17:22.440 --> 17:24.560
I got you killed.

17:33.760 --> 17:36.680
I gave you away

17:40.560 --> 17:42.800
and put you in danger.

17:47.000 --> 17:49.200
My complacence

17:52.080 --> 17:53.320
killed you.

18:07.240 --> 18:10.880
I just want you to live on well.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.440
You can love me

18:15.560 --> 18:17.000
or hate me.

18:19.000 --> 18:21.680
Even if you forget about me,

18:24.720 --> 18:26.520
I won't care.

18:31.160 --> 18:32.880
But why

18:37.200 --> 18:40.160
is even that a vain hope?

20:04.560 --> 20:07.480
To fly together in the sky.

20:09.640 --> 20:12.480
To grow together on the earth.

20:15.000 --> 20:18.400
We share blessings and misfortunes.

20:20.520 --> 20:23.400
We go through thick and thin.

20:24.960 --> 20:26.360
We share

20:27.920 --> 20:28.960
the same bed.

20:30.320 --> 20:31.640
We rest

20:32.680 --> 20:33.800
hand-in-hand.

20:52.400 --> 20:53.520
I promised

20:54.840 --> 20:56.840
to spend the rest of my life with you.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.960
I'm coming for you.

22:17.640 --> 22:18.680
Let go.

22:21.800 --> 22:24.160
Why can't you let yourself go?

22:25.640 --> 22:27.880
Murong Jinghe, I must see her.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.080
Where is she?

22:30.560 --> 22:31.400
Yue Qin,

22:32.760 --> 22:34.200
- how dare you come here!
- My Lord.

22:34.280 --> 22:35.440
My Lord!

22:38.880 --> 22:40.720
Mei Lin. Mei Lin!

22:45.000 --> 22:46.720
- Where is she?
- Let me see her.

22:46.800 --> 22:47.920
- I beg you.
- You don't deserve that.

22:50.760 --> 22:51.840
Get lost!

22:52.440 --> 22:54.320
I must see her. Let me see her.

23:10.680 --> 23:12.360
- I must see her.
- See her?

23:12.440 --> 23:14.200
How dare you let her die?

23:14.280 --> 23:17.000
- Let me see her.
- You promised me she'd be free.

23:32.080 --> 23:33.360
Let me see her.

23:36.440 --> 23:38.200
Your Excellency,
the princess's body is missing.

23:39.880 --> 23:40.920
Mei Lin.

23:47.280 --> 23:50.360
I'm sorry, Your Highness.
I can't watch you hurt yourself.

23:55.920 --> 23:56.880
Mei Lin!

23:57.520 --> 23:58.360
Mei Lin.

24:00.000 --> 24:02.840
My Lord. My Lord, the blood…

24:02.920 --> 24:05.840
The blood doesn't look like someone
who died six days ago.

24:05.920 --> 24:06.960
What?

24:07.040 --> 24:09.560
Something's wrong.
It belongs to a living person.

24:14.800 --> 24:16.840
My Lord, what should we do?

24:17.800 --> 24:18.680
My Lord.

24:18.760 --> 24:19.680
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

24:30.240 --> 24:31.400
Mei Lin!

24:31.480 --> 24:33.360
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

24:35.840 --> 24:36.680
Mei Lin.

24:36.760 --> 24:39.840
Mei Lin, open the door.
I know you're in there.

24:39.920 --> 24:41.040
Mei Lin, open the door.

24:41.800 --> 24:45.040
Mei Lin! I know you're in there.
Open the door.

24:45.120 --> 24:45.960
Your Excellency,

24:46.040 --> 24:48.240
the shopkeeper of Yanlai Fragrance Shop
is out of town.

24:48.320 --> 24:50.240
They haven't been open for a few days.

25:08.160 --> 25:09.240
Mei Lin,

25:12.840 --> 25:14.240
you're hiding,

25:15.040 --> 25:16.360
aren't you?

25:19.320 --> 25:20.560
You don't want to see me,

25:23.000 --> 25:23.840
do you?

25:30.480 --> 25:31.600
Mei Lin.

25:33.200 --> 25:35.120
- Mei Lin.
- My Lord.

25:46.920 --> 25:48.240
What are you doing?

25:58.680 --> 26:00.960
Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

27:04.280 --> 27:05.240
Mei Lin,

27:07.400 --> 27:09.120
where are you now?

27:39.040 --> 27:40.800
Why isn't she breathing?

27:40.880 --> 27:42.720
Will Mei wake up?

27:45.280 --> 27:46.120
Mei.

27:48.000 --> 27:49.720
It's the seventh day.

27:50.480 --> 27:51.720
Mei said she'd wake up,

27:53.360 --> 27:54.400
and she will.

28:00.800 --> 28:03.720
Mei, I'm scared.

28:05.760 --> 28:07.800
Yi, don't worry.

28:08.720 --> 28:11.720
This bamboo nail will gradually
seal my blood and breath.

28:11.800 --> 28:14.840
In seven days, I'll look like a corpse.

28:15.920 --> 28:18.680
After seven days, I will wake up.

28:20.520 --> 28:22.920
But it's such a long bamboo nail.

28:25.680 --> 28:28.840
Trust me. I'm not wrong about this.

28:29.440 --> 28:31.000
I will wake up.

29:04.760 --> 29:06.280
Why is she still so cold?

29:07.000 --> 29:07.840
Mei.

29:08.880 --> 29:10.520
Did Mei lie to us?

29:12.240 --> 29:14.480
Mei, if you lied,

29:14.560 --> 29:17.080
I'll throw you into the woods in Xiyan
and feed you to the bears.

29:21.920 --> 29:23.040
Here.

29:26.360 --> 29:29.040
God bless Mei.

29:29.120 --> 29:30.240
She must wake up.

29:33.280 --> 29:34.120
Mei.

29:35.920 --> 29:36.760
Come on.

29:47.960 --> 29:49.160
Yi.

29:49.240 --> 29:51.400
Yi, Mei is awake.

29:52.040 --> 29:52.960
Mei is awake.

29:53.600 --> 29:54.440
Mei,

29:55.400 --> 29:56.880
how do you feel?

29:57.920 --> 29:59.000
Mei.

30:09.840 --> 30:11.640
Mei, I was so scared.

30:13.280 --> 30:15.240
Mei, you finally woke up.

30:18.000 --> 30:18.880
Jia.

30:24.040 --> 30:25.200
Yi.

30:27.360 --> 30:29.960
Mei, Yi told me everything.

30:30.800 --> 30:32.280
You suffered so much.

30:32.360 --> 30:33.840
You should have told me sooner.

30:36.400 --> 30:37.920
It's good

30:39.040 --> 30:42.240
to be alive and see you.

30:45.280 --> 30:47.840
I already died once.

30:49.840 --> 30:51.720
I'm grateful

30:54.280 --> 30:55.600
to be alive now.

30:57.600 --> 30:58.680
The poison in me…

30:58.760 --> 31:01.000
Mei, the poison can be neutralized.

31:01.080 --> 31:06.080
Yes. The hunters said
Snow Dragon Whisker lives with the snow.

31:06.160 --> 31:08.960
In four months, during the big snowstorm

31:09.040 --> 31:11.120
in the mountains,
we will find a new Snow Dragon Whisker

31:11.200 --> 31:12.560
to save your life.

31:12.640 --> 31:15.720
Those hunters also said
the first snowfall in past years

31:15.800 --> 31:17.360
was at this time of year.

31:17.960 --> 31:19.560
You will stay here for more days.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.720
Don't worry. Everything's taken care of.

31:21.800 --> 31:24.440
- No one will find you here.
- Oh, right.

31:24.520 --> 31:26.720
You said you wanted
to learn business from me.

31:26.800 --> 31:29.360
I've already found a store
near the fragrance shop

31:30.200 --> 31:32.240
for you to open a cake shop.

31:33.000 --> 31:35.120
There's no rush.

31:35.200 --> 31:36.760
You need to recover first.

31:36.840 --> 31:39.400
You can't be a shopkeeper
without good health like mine.

31:39.480 --> 31:40.520
Alright now.

31:41.320 --> 31:43.760
Stop talking. Let Mei get some rest.

31:43.840 --> 31:45.560
Let's go make porridge for her.

31:47.200 --> 31:48.800
Mei, take a good rest.

31:48.880 --> 31:50.240
We will make you some porridge.

31:52.120 --> 31:52.960
Okay now. Let's go.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.400
Let's go.

31:59.920 --> 32:02.120
Jia, Yi,

32:03.360 --> 32:04.520
I probably won't

32:05.920 --> 32:08.240
be able to wait four months
for the big snow.

32:16.360 --> 32:18.720
TWO DAYS LATER

32:19.760 --> 32:21.440
- I need this.
- And another one with meat.

32:23.240 --> 32:24.880
Miss, you have great taste.

32:24.960 --> 32:25.960
It smells great.

32:26.040 --> 32:26.960
Here. Take this.

32:27.040 --> 32:28.880
Sugarcoated haws.

32:28.960 --> 32:30.720
Sweet sugarcoated haws.

32:30.800 --> 32:31.680
Sugarcoated haws.

32:32.760 --> 32:35.120
- Sugarcoated haws.
- Freshly baked fruit cakes.

32:35.200 --> 32:37.680
- Take a look at the sugarcoated haws.
- Come and take a look.

32:40.200 --> 32:41.800
Check this out.

32:41.880 --> 32:43.960
Take a look
at the freshly baked fruit cakes.

32:46.480 --> 32:48.400
- Miss.
- Sugarcoated haws.

32:48.480 --> 32:50.560
Jiahe Cake Shop is open today.

32:50.640 --> 32:52.080
Welcome to buy more cakes at my store.

32:52.720 --> 32:53.880
Sugarcoated haws.

32:53.960 --> 32:54.800
Here.

32:55.960 --> 32:56.960
The freshly baked cakes are delicious.

32:57.040 --> 32:58.400
Thank you.

32:58.480 --> 32:59.320
You're welcome.

33:03.520 --> 33:06.560
Today, the old houses
on Qinglin Lane are repaired.

33:06.640 --> 33:09.480
It'll be much warmer in winter.

33:09.560 --> 33:11.560
- Yeah.
- Qingzhou is returning to the way it was.

33:11.640 --> 33:13.080
Let's drink to that.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.920
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

33:15.480 --> 33:17.040
I'm telling you, no cheating.

33:17.760 --> 33:19.520
- Bottoms up.
- Okay. Bottoms up.

33:23.320 --> 33:25.520
Father, Mother,

33:27.320 --> 33:29.200
the wine at the liquor store smells good.

33:30.760 --> 33:32.200
The fruit cakes are sweet.

33:34.080 --> 33:36.000
Mr. Li and the others are doing well.

33:36.800 --> 33:41.000
Qingzhou has finally returned
to how it was before the fire.

33:41.080 --> 33:43.400
Hurry up. The Lancang River spectacle
has appeared in Qingzhou.

33:43.480 --> 33:44.480
It's a once-in-a-century.

33:44.560 --> 33:45.840
- Hurry up, or it will be too late.
- Hurry up.

33:45.920 --> 33:47.600
- Hurry!
- Wait for me.

33:47.680 --> 33:49.240
- I need to get my stuff.
- It's just ahead.

33:50.120 --> 33:51.320
Lancang River.

33:55.000 --> 33:57.280
Look at that. That's so beautiful.

33:57.360 --> 33:58.200
Yes, it's beautiful. Look at that.

34:16.480 --> 34:18.480
- It's the governor.
- Your Excellency?

34:19.040 --> 34:20.560
The governor looks so strange.

34:20.639 --> 34:22.679
Yeah. Why is he wearing a wedding dress?

34:26.400 --> 34:28.360
It's so beautiful. Let's make a wish.

34:29.840 --> 34:31.080
It's beautiful.

34:40.639 --> 34:42.199
It's so beautiful.

34:45.760 --> 34:47.880
Where did they come from? Do you know?

34:48.480 --> 34:49.639
I don't know.

34:53.480 --> 34:56.280
Lan'er, look. These little things

34:56.360 --> 34:58.000
swam hundreds of lis
along the warm currents

34:58.080 --> 35:01.120
of the Lancang River
before arriving in Qingzhou.

35:02.200 --> 35:03.880
Lan'er, watch carefully.

35:03.960 --> 35:06.720
They'll only be here for three months.

35:06.800 --> 35:08.880
What will happen after?

35:10.120 --> 35:13.000
It took them two months to swim
to Qingzhou.

35:13.080 --> 35:15.240
The summer in Qingzhou
is especially short.

35:15.320 --> 35:17.120
They can't survive when it's cold.

35:31.160 --> 35:34.080
Look. Aren't they amazing?

35:34.840 --> 35:39.040
Lan'er, you must be persistent like them.

35:46.400 --> 35:47.480
Three months.

35:54.720 --> 35:58.800
They know they're nearing
the end of their lives,

36:00.200 --> 36:02.400
but they run toward the brief summer.

36:04.600 --> 36:06.200
Is it worth it?

36:22.120 --> 36:24.800
The warmer it is,
the brighter the mayfly light.

36:25.400 --> 36:27.320
They shine freely
to their hearts' content,

36:27.400 --> 36:29.120
brighter than the stars in the sky.

36:29.200 --> 36:32.200
Even if they're short-lived,
it's worth it.

37:03.840 --> 37:06.160
Lan'er, are you happy today?

37:06.240 --> 37:07.400
Yes.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.920
Look at that, Lan'er.

37:13.000 --> 37:14.880
- Is it pretty?
- Yes.

37:57.040 --> 37:58.240
- Mei Lin.
- Mei Lin.

38:06.360 --> 38:08.120
That man came to see you
at the fragrance shop.

38:08.200 --> 38:09.680
Luckily, you were out.

38:09.760 --> 38:11.600
He should have accepted the truth.

38:12.320 --> 38:15.240
However, are you really
not going to see him?

38:18.120 --> 38:20.520
Mei Lin has been buried.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.240
I have a new name,

38:25.280 --> 38:26.720
which is

38:27.600 --> 38:28.800
Spring

38:29.880 --> 38:30.720
Flower,

38:31.720 --> 38:32.560
Miss Hua.

38:33.560 --> 38:34.400
Miss Hua?

38:36.600 --> 38:37.520
Right.

38:37.600 --> 38:40.720
Miss Hua, I've heard
you're a good embroiderer.

38:54.600 --> 38:56.080
Miss Hua.

39:00.920 --> 39:02.080
That's nice.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.640
No one

39:08.760 --> 39:10.520
will disturb you again.
